        <mxCell id="monitor" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:23px&quot;&gt;GIÁM SÁT  ·  COMPOSE RIÊNG&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Serilog → Seq :5341  |  /metrics → Prometheus :9090 → Grafana :3000&lt;br/&gt;Operations agent → API K8s / từng Pod  |  Metrics Server cấp CPU cho HPA&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#19324D;fontSize=19;strokeColor=#7890A5;fillColor=#F6F8FB;strokeWidth=1.7;spacing=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="50" y="1100" width="1030" height="110" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bkp" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:23px&quot;&gt;SAO LƯU  ·  BUNDLE LOCAL → PHỤC HỒI CÁCH LY&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Gateway / Hangfire → PG base + WAL, Mongo snapshot, Kafka offsets, file + SHA-256&lt;br/&gt;Restore → chatapp-recovery · Web :4201 · Network / volumes riêng · Tắt lịch backup&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#19324D;fontSize=19;strokeColor=#32835B;fillColor=#F0F8F1;strokeWidth=1.7;spacing=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
